    'Walk': ['Put your thumb on the left side of the screen and move it to walk. Push all the way forward to sprint.', ['Left thumb']],
    'Jump': ['Tap JUMP.', ['JUMP']],
    'Meet Bolt': ['That little robot is Bolt. Tap on him to talk. Tap an answer to choose it. (Chests open the same way: just tap them.)', ['Tap Bolt', 'Tap an answer']],
    'Shoot': ['A training drone! Aim at it and tap anywhere on the right side of the screen to shoot. Hold FIRE for non-stop fire (you can drag your thumb on it to aim). RELOAD refills your gun.', ['Tap to shoot', 'FIRE', 'RELOAD']],
    'Phase Wraith': ["Bullets pass straight through a Phase Wraith. Tap FREEZE to switch on your stasis beam and point it at the Wraith. Once it's frozen and solid, shoot it! Tap FREEZE again to switch it off.", ['FREEZE on/off', 'Tap to shoot']],
    'Aegis Knight': ['Its shield blocks every shot from the front. Switch on FREEZE to shut the shield off, or circle behind it and shoot the orange core on its back.', ['FREEZE on', 'or flank']],
    'Blades': ['Here, a Thermal Katana! Tap its slot at the top right to hold it. Tap three times quickly for a combo. Switch on GUARD to block shots. Slash the trooper!', ['Tap the slot', 'Tap x3', 'GUARD']],
    'Build cover': ['Tap BUILD to pick a wall (tap again for ramp, floor, then off), then tap the screen to place it. Walls stop enemy shots.', ['BUILD', 'Tap to place']],
